        <param name="allowHandoffWithoutPackageInstalled">whether the activity should be handed off even if the package is not installed on the remote device.</param>
        <summary>Sets whether the activity should be handed off even if the package is not installed on the remote device.</summary>
        <returns>the builder. This value cannot be null.</returns>
        <remarks>
          <para>Sets whether the activity should be handed off even if the package is not installed on the remote device. If this is set to false, this activity will not appear as a Handoff suggestion on devices which do not have the package installed.</para>
